---
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
import SampleComponent from "@components/SampleComponent.astro";
import Container from "@components/Container.astro";
import AstroLogo from "@assets/images/astro-logo-light-gradient.png";
import { Content as SampleMarkdown } from "@content/sample-markdown.md";
import { Assets } from "astro:assets";
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";

import Logo from './LongLogo-Idea-20.png';

import ImagePopout from "@components/ImagePopout.astro";


import Nav from "@components/Nav.astro"
import Footer from "@components/Footer.astro"
import ProjectButton from "@components/ProjectButton.astro";

---

<Layout title="Esports Visualized">
  <Nav />
  <div style=" margin: 100px; "></div>
  <Container>
    <div class="about">
        <h1>About the Project</h1>
        <ImagePopout image={Logo} alt="logo for Esports Visualized" />
        <p>
          Esports Visualized is a project that focuses on how graphic design takes shape in the context of the Esports community.
          This project highlights a few different specific areas of graphic design and focuses on how they are different or unique
          in the context of Esports. These are done in the form of case studies, where I discuss the aspect of design itself and how
          it differs when applied to Esports but take it one step further and apply it myself to give a visual demonstration of
          what is discussed in the case study. The case studies that I have highlighted for this project are event design, collegiate design,
          and 3D design These will all be real and applied designs made for a purpose in order to give an
          accurate depiction of what it is like to design for Esports and the unique challenges that come with it!
        </p>
        <p>
          My name is Tyler Boggi and I have been designing for the Esports space for 3 years now from clubs, to organizations,
          to much more. It’s a pleasure to be able to share everything that I’ve learned here and then some. With this project my goal
          is to get people interested in the scene of Esports and its flourishing and truly unique design opportunities!
          If you’d like to learn more on how you can start playing your favorite games competitively or just join the scene for the enjoyment
          of all the unique opportunities and graphic design that goes on then contact me!
        </p>
    </div>
  </Container>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<script>
</script>

<style>
  /*About Section*/
  .about{
    display: flex;
    flex-flow: column nowrap;
    height: fit-content;
    gap: 30px;
  }
  
</style>